{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"article","seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Forge\/documentation\/Forge\/AppContainer","doc:\/\/Forge\/documentation\/Forge\/Forge","doc:\/\/Forge\/documentation\/Forge\/Container","doc:\/\/Forge\/documentation\/Forge\/Scope"],"generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Forge is a lightweight dependency injection framework for Swift. This guide walks you","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"through installation and registering your first dependencies. Forge offers two paths:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Simple Setup"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — extend the built-in ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Forge\/documentation\/Forge\/AppContainer","type":"reference"},{"text":" and use ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Forge\/documentation\/Forge\/Inject","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" immediately.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Best for single-target apps and getting started quickly."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Modular Setup","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — create your own container per module with a local typealias."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Best for multi-module SPM architectures."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Installation","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Installation"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add Forge to your project via Swift Package Manager. In your "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Package.swift"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["dependencies: [","    .package(url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/tatejennings\/forge.git\", from: \"0.1.0\")","]"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Then add ","type":"text"},{"code":"Forge","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to your target’s dependencies:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":[".target(name: \"MyApp\", dependencies: [\"Forge\"])"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Or add it via Xcode: ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"File > Add Packages","type":"text"}]},{"text":", enter the repository URL, and add","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Forge","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to your target.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Simple Setup","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Simple-Setup"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Extend the built-in "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Forge\/documentation\/Forge\/AppContainer","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" with your dependencies. The framework-provided"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Forge\/documentation\/Forge\/Inject","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" typealias lets you inject them anywhere — no container class to write,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"no typealias to define, no setup code at all:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["import Forge","","extension AppContainer {","    var networkClient: any NetworkClientProtocol {","        provide(.singleton) { URLSessionNetworkClient() }","    }","","    var authService: any AuthServiceProtocol {","        provide(.singleton) {","            AuthService(network: self.networkClient)","        } preview: {","            MockAuthService()","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then inject anywhere:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["final class LoginViewModel {","    @ObservationIgnored","    @Inject(\\.authService) private var authService","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"That’s it. No "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"App.init()"},{"type":"text","text":", no manual wiring, no boilerplate."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Modular Setup","anchor":"Modular-Setup"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For apps with multiple SPM modules, create a container per module by subclassing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Forge\/documentation\/Forge\/Container"},{"type":"text","text":" and conforming to "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Forge\/documentation\/Forge\/SharedContainer","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":". Add a module-local typealias"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to shadow the framework’s "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Forge\/documentation\/Forge\/Inject"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"code":["import Forge","","\/\/ The module-local typealias shadows the framework-provided one","typealias Inject<T> = ContainerInject<AuthContainer, T>","","final class AuthContainer: Container, SharedContainer {","    static let shared = AuthContainer()","","    var authService: any AuthServiceProtocol {","        provide(.singleton) {","            AuthService(network: self.networkClient)","        } preview: {","            MockAuthService()","        }","    }","","    var tokenStorage: any TokenStorageProtocol {","        provide { KeychainTokenStorage() }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"anchor":"The-Module-Local-Typealias","type":"heading","text":"The Module-Local Typealias"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"typealias Inject<T> = ContainerInject<AuthContainer, T>"},{"type":"text","text":" line is placed "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"container file itself"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — not in a separate file. This typealias shadows the framework’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"built-in "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Forge\/documentation\/Forge\/Inject","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" within this module, so "},{"code":"@Inject(\\.authService)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" resolves from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"AuthContainer","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" instead of "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Forge\/documentation\/Forge\/AppContainer","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["@Inject(\\.authService) private var auth"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you later rename or refactor the container, only the typealias needs updating."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Choose a Scope","level":2,"anchor":"Choose-a-Scope"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every dependency has a lifecycle controlled by "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Forge\/documentation\/Forge\/Scope","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Scope"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Behavior"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".transient"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"New instance every time (default)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".singleton"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"One instance for the container’s lifetime"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".cached"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"One instance until "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Forge\/documentation\/Forge\/Container\/resetCa